{%- comment -%}
  Koozie multi-buy prices (2026-11-19), shown under the price on products tagged "koozie".
  Must match the automatic discounts in admin: "Koozies: 2 or more for $10 each", "4 or more for $9 each",
  "6 or more for $8.50 each" (and the tiers in assets/mw-cart.js, data-koozie-tiers in snippets/cart-drawer.liquid).
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="mw-deal" role="note" aria-label="Koozie multi-buy prices">
  <p class="mw-deal__head"><strong>Buy more, pay less</strong> &middot; mix any designs and colours</p>
  <ol class="mw-deal__tiers">
    <li><span class="mw-deal__qty">1</span><span class="mw-deal__price">$12</span></li>
    <li><span class="mw-deal__qty">2+</span><span class="mw-deal__price">$10 <small>each</small></span></li>
    <li><span class="mw-deal__qty">4+</span><span class="mw-deal__price">$9 <small>each</small></span></li>
    <li class="is-best"><span class="mw-deal__qty">6+</span><span class="mw-deal__price">$8.50 <small>each</small></span></li>
  </ol>
  <p class="mw-deal__note">The price drops automatically in your cart. Six koozies: $51 instead of $72.</p>
</div>
